# ============================================================
# 21. SEO: TRAILING SLASH NORMALISATION — DISABLED FOR REACT
# ============================================================
# Disabled: React Router manages URL structure internally.
# Forcing trailing slashes would conflict with client-side routing
# and cause redirect loops on pages like /safaris, /about, /contact.
# Re-enable only if you migrate away from a React SPA architecture.

